{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"S5 (343b) CLAIMED after PASS (0 blocking). Plan needed three corrections: (1) stale citation sidecar.py:601 -> :629; (2) the Approach's core mechanism was IMPOSSIBLE — provider_factory is pydantic-ai's fixed (str)->Provider hook and cannot return provenance; replaced with assembly in runner.run(), which already holds resolved/_provider_name/caps/cfg.base_url, leaving providers.py (299/300) untouched entirely; (3) a THIRD write site, code_review/sidecar.py:105, was missing from Scope — the most consequential, since code review is the gate being cut over to Bedrock. Stack now 8 deep (1012/1014/1023/1032/1043/1048/1067/1081) after rebasing onto a main that had moved 13 commits; three SEMANTIC conflicts resolved on evidence (main's new web-search block vs f184's capability-based caching vs dc0d's single caps resolution — naively taking either side would have silently dropped a feature). Filed and fixed 3a98: main grew runner.py to 798, making 2682's attested <700 unreachable; moved the pai preflight cluster into structured_run.py (runner 680, structured_run 255, ZERO test edits because runner re-imports both so the 15 monkeypatch seams still bind). PROCESS DEFECT OF MINE, recorded so it is not repeated: 'make lint 2>&1 | tail -2 && ...' masks failure because a pipeline's exit status is tail's, not make's — one push went out after a FAILED commit for this reason. Now capturing exit codes directly."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785457728216381001,"uuid":"331e8079-e2e7-4645-ad44-e090f55f4bd1"}